@startuml 001-activity-session-component
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title 001 活動與階段同步 — 組件圖（相依方向：外層 → 核心）

actor "老師" as Teacher
actor "學生（各組）" as Student

package "外層：畫面與 API（轉接層）" {
  [老師畫面\n（建立活動、開輪、關輪、結束／取消、\n查看各組憑證、刪除空組）] as TeacherUI
  [學生畫面\n（加入組別、身分恢復、階段顯示、\n查看本組憑證、離開本組）] as StudentUI
  [活動 API（HTTP）\n（解析 token 與 Idempotency-Key、錯誤訊息轉換；\n共用錯誤格式與請求日誌在 common.py）] as Api
  [同步推送 WebSocketHub（只推送）\n（實作 SyncPublisher：依角色裁切完整快照、狀態版本、ping）] as Sync
  [倒數排程 AsyncioCountdownScheduler\n（實作 CountdownScheduler）] as TimerImpl
  [系統時鐘 SystemClock\n（實作 Clock）] as ClockImpl
}

package "應用層" {
  [活動服務\n（實作 002 的 ActivityGateway；\n每活動一把鎖序列化操作、鎖內 Idempotency-Key 去重）] as Service
  [ports：CountdownScheduler、SyncPublisher、Clock\n（Protocol，由外層實作；倒數到期以\nmax(現在, 截止時間) 關輪）] as Ports
  [活動登錄表\n（只存在記憶體，重啟清空）] as Registry
}

package "核心（純函式：不依賴網路、Web 框架、系統時鐘）" {
  [階段狀態機\n（目前狀態 + 操作 + 傳入時間 → 新狀態或拒絕原因）] as StateMachine
  [輸入規則\n（組名正規化、倒數 1～3600 秒、選題檢查、\n換組與刪組條件）] as Rules
  [快照裁切\n（老師版／學生版，只含自己組資料）] as View
}

package "其他子功能（依賴 001）" {
  [002 匯入服務] as Import
  [003 提交服務] as Submit
  [004 順位與定案] as Ranking
  [005 匯出] as Export
}

Teacher --> TeacherUI
Student --> StudentUI
TeacherUI --> Api
StudentUI --> Api
TeacherUI <.. Sync : 推送
StudentUI <.. Sync : 推送
Api --> Service
TimerImpl ..|> Ports
Sync ..|> Ports
ClockImpl ..|> Ports
TimerImpl --> Service : 截止時呼叫 onDeadline
Service --> Registry
Service --> StateMachine
Service --> Rules
Service --> View
Service --> Ports : 經 SyncPublisher 通知狀態變更
Import --> Service : 查詢階段／老師身分、\n替換題目
Submit --> Service : 查詢輪次與組別身分
Ranking --> Service : 確認定案
Export --> Service : 讀取已結束活動
@enduml
